  "display_title": "What’s His Destiny",
  "description": "Kim Yun didn't mind being the one to confess first, especially since he knew Kwon Yong-Ha felt the same. But \"no\" wasn't the answer he expected, and he definitely didn't expect his rejector to burst into a fit of sorrowful tears! Yong-Ha clearly wants him, so why is he pushing him away? Yun is determined to find out what kind of strange destiny is keeping them apart, even if he has to drag the truth out of Yong-Ha himself.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Part of Lezhin's Hachankong Danpyeonseon (하찮공 단편선) Collection.*",
